These are generated Mesa build headers for the native Orbis RADV command-buffer
translation unit. They contain no game data. Original file notices are retained.

Mesa source commit: 1a59cc147b54e3970814b37313e2f27357672e9d
Configuration and SHA-256 inputs: manifest.json
Reproduction tool: tools/build_radv_command_overlay.py

Only generated headers are stored here. The tool reads the corresponding clean
source blobs from that pinned commit in external/mesa-ps4, independently of local
worktree edits. SDK headers and the compiler remain separate pinned inputs.
Before accepting a tuned object, it rebuilds the generic baseline and compares
all ELF sections, relocations and symbol records with the original SDK member.
The only permitted baseline difference is the compiler-version .comment section.

